  h2 Factors affecting Physical Growth

  ol.complex-list
    li
      hl Heredity
    li
      hl Nutrition
      |  : Effect of malnutrition is reversible to certain extent. 
      br
      | If malnutrition not too severe &rarr; when proper nutrition provided &rarr; Growth accelerates. 
      hl (Catch-up Growth)
    li
      hl Illness
    li
      hl Race
      |  : Calcification &amp; eruption of teeth occurs almost 1 year earlier in American blacks than whites.
    li
      hl Socio-economic Factors
    li
